{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:22e366a95fbc40a5","name":"Armen Arandis","source":{"id":"source:reference-22e366a95fbc40a5","title":"Armen Arandis","revision":15897,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:53:23Z","sha256":"63d82b50f81177aa9a758019127ef813c5edd837eda5ecb236e77fd5966a2e16","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=15897","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Armen%20Arandis&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-22e366a95fbc40a5","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dawn of Defiance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dawn_of_Defiance"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["The Queen of Air and Darkness"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Queen_of_Air_and_Darkness","referenceId":"reference:807bd67869870b44"},")"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["On either the first or second day, one hero participating in the tournament has a chance to interact with the officer from The ",{"tag":"i","children":["Assiduous"]},". The two are paired up at one of the sabacc tables, and as the day wears on, the hero should have a chance to talk to the officer, who names himself Lt. Armen Arandis. Lt. Arandis wears his Imperial uniform during the tournament, and each day it looks crisp, clean, and neatly pressed. He is young, perhaps not long out of the Imperial Academy, and his cool gaze is disrupted only by a long scar that cuts diagonally across his face, starting at one temple, crossing his right eye, and ending at his upper lip.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Lt. Arandis is the picture of Imperial discipline, and he is also an excellent gambler. He begins with an Unfriendly ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attitude"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attitu